;   $40 heart full  $41 heart empty  $42-$4A life bar 0/8..8/8
;   $4B bar left cap  $4C bar right cap  $4D otter head  $4E crawfish
;   $4F eagle  $50 progress track  $51 track start  $52 track home
;   $53 Ollie marker on the track  $54 air bubble
