; ===================================================================
; Menu / frame decorations $60-$7F.  The frame is a bamboo cane: the
; empty row 7 reads as the cane's node, so vertical sides stay neat.
;   $60 TL  $61 top  $62 TR  $63 left  $64 right  $65 BL  $66 bottom
;   $67 BR  $68/$69 wave (two phases)  $6A divider  $6B divider gem
;   $6C/$6D grass tufts  $6E arrow up  $6F arrow down  $70 fish
;   $71 paw print  $72 water drop  $73 bullet dot  $74 check mark
;   $75 cross  $76 heart small  $77 sparkle
; ===================================================================
@tchars at=$60 color=13 names=FRAME_TL,FRAME_TOP,FRAME_TR,FRAME_LEFT,FRAME_RIGHT,FRAME_BL,FRAME_BOTTOM,FRAME_BR
........ ........ ........ ..###... ...###.. ..###... ........ ...###..
